 r←Test_FailFnError dummy;router;req;result
 ⍝ An error in OnFailFn is handled like a handler error, through OnErrorFn
 router←⎕NEW #.Stark
 router.Handlers←#.Mocks.MockHandlers
 router.OnFailFn←'BrokenFailFn'
 router.OnErrorFn←'HandleError'
 req←⎕NEW #.Mocks.MockRequest ('GET' '/nope')
 result←router._Dispatch req
 r←(500=req.Response.Status)∧('deliberate OnFailFn error'≡result.message)
